==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*3 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*4 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[R.Ost]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*7 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 15~20 seconds<sup>450f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 50~55 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,650f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A consistent cheese for at least 1-Crown can be done before THE SLOTH and R.Ost could spawn. Wait until the first Bore Jr. spawns, and summon [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] alongside [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to kill him for [[Extra Money]]. Then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cats]], and whatever other rushers you have for a quick and easy victory. Make sure you bring [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]] to prevent subsequent Bore Jr.s from sniping your Awakened Bahamut Cat from behind the enemy base. Starting Money [[Cat Combo]]s make this strategy easier to pull off.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Theatre of Fear]] stages, A Pile of Guts is named after a horror movie, though it was not properly localized. A Pile of Guts' Japanese name is Harawata no Shiryō-shitsu (はらわたの史料室, "Gut Archives"), which sounds similar to the Japanese name of ''[[wikipedia:The Evil Dead|The Evil Dead]]'': ''Shiryō no Harawata'' (死霊のはらわた, "Guts of Spirits").
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]]:
**The first group of Bore Jrs had 8 members instead of 4.
**The second group of Bore Jrs had 13 members instead of 7, with 10~13.33 seconds between Bore Jrs instead of 15~20.
**The unlimited Bore Jrs spawned 33.33~36.67 seconds apart instead of 50~55.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 4,200. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

